synce-core (0.17-0~bookworm3) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * python/pyrapi2.pyx: Port to Cython 3 / Python 3.
    - Add "# cython: language_level=3" directive.
    - Replace PyString_FromStringAndSize with PyBytes_FromStringAndSize.
    - Replace PyCObject_FromVoidPtr with PyCapsule_New (capsule name
      "IRAPISession" for interop with python3-rra).
    - Fix Python 2-isms: 259L long literals → 259, basestring → (str, bytes).
  * python/Makefile.am: Use $(PYREX) (cython3) instead of pyrexc; set
    rapibindingsdir to dist-packages path so libtool installs the .so
    under /usr/lib/python3.11/dist-packages (Debian convention).
  * m4/python.m4: Fix AM_CHECK_PYTHON_HEADERS to use print() instead of
    Python 2 print statement when probing sys.prefix.
  * configure.ac: Replace AC_CHECK_PROGS(PYREX, pyrexc) with cython3,
    update minimum Python version to 3.0, remove Pyrex 0.9.6 version check,
    update PYREX existence test for cython3.
  * debian/control: Add cython3, python3-dev to Build-Depends; add new
    binary package python3-rapi2.
  * debian/rules: Enable python bindings (--enable-python-bindings),
    add --with python3 for dh_python3 integration.
  * debian/python3-rapi2.install: New file (glob python3*/dist-packages).
  * debian/not-installed: Add pyrapi2.la, pyrapi2.a.
  * debian/patches/07_cython3_bindings.diff: New patch capturing all
    above source-tree changes.

